     <actual value="0.00">
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">Final data for this indicator was supposed to be collected in the final project evaluation undertaken by the PIU but the datacollected was of poor quality and incomplete. This data deficiency will be somewhat rectified for the ICM through a new survey butit is likely that full data on the perceptions by community members of whether their expected results for micro-projects wereachieved will not be available.</narrative>
      </comment>
